{
  "Merge Upstream Prompt": {
    "prefix": "merge-prompt",
    "body": [
      "I need to merge LibreChat upstream version ${1:v0.8.5} into Paychex develop branch.",
      "",
      "**Context:**",
      "- Current version: ${2:v0.8.4}",
      "- Target version: ${1:v0.8.5}",
      "- Merge branch: feature/merge-upstream-${1:v0.8.5}",
      "- Repository: Paychex LibreChat fork",
      "- Documentation: docs/merge-process/UPSTREAM_MERGE_GUIDE.md",
      "",
      "**Critical Paychex Customizations to Preserve:**",
      "",
      "1. **Tool Call Filtering** (api/app/clients/BaseClient.js)",
      "   - Method: `filterCrossProviderToolCalls`",
      "",
      "2. **Schema Sanitization** (api/server/services/start/tools.js)",
      "   - Import and usage of `sanitizeSchemaMetadata`",
      "",
      "3. **Gemini Endpoint Detection** (api/server/services/MCP.js)",
      "   - Pattern: `providerLower.includes('gemini') || providerLower.includes('google')`",
      "",
      "4. **Pendo Analytics** (ModelSelector.tsx)",
      "   - Element: `<span id=\"agentUsers\" />`",
      "",
      "5. **Menu Descriptions** (DropdownPopup.tsx)",
      "   - `item.description`, `items-start`, CSS transitions",
      "",
      "6. **Dockerfile Error Handling** - `&&` operators",
      "",
      "7. **xlsx Package** - `\"xlsx\": \"^0.18.5\"` (npm registry)",
      "",
      "**Requirements:**",
      "",
      "✅ **Must Do:**",
      "- Check git history: `git log develop -- <file>`",
      "- Use Decision Matrix from UPSTREAM_MERGE_GUIDE.md",
      "- Preserve ALL customizations",
      "- Verify: `./scripts/verify-paychex-customizations.sh`",
      "- Build and test before committing",
      "",
      "❌ **Must Not:**",
      "- Blindly accept upstream",
      "- Remove Paychex customizations",
      "- Skip verification",
      "",
      "**Please:**",
      "1. Analyze conflicts and categorize by risk",
      "2. Guide me through resolving systematically",
      "3. Ask for confirmation before major decisions",
      "4. Verify all customizations preserved",
      "5. Help create commit message",
      "",
      "Ready to start?"
    ],
    "description": "Full prompt template for AI-assisted upstream merge"
  },
  "Update Verification Prompt": {
    "prefix": "update-verify",
    "body": [
      "I need to update scripts/verify-paychex-customizations.sh to verify new Paychex customizations.",
      "",
      "**New Customizations to Add:**",
      "",
      "1. **Customization Name:** ${1:Feature Name}",
      "   - **File:** ${2:api/server/services/Feature.js}",
      "   - **Pattern:** ${3:paychexFeatureConfig}",
      "   - **Description:** ${4:What this customization does}",
      "   - **Criticality:** ${5|critical,warning|}",
      "   - **Context:** ${6:What breaks if this is lost}",
      "",
      "**Requirements:**",
      "- Add new checks maintaining existing script structure",
      "- Use clear section numbering",
      "- Include descriptive echo statements",
      "- Follow same format as existing check_pattern() calls",
      "",
      "**Deliverable:**",
      "Update scripts/verify-paychex-customizations.sh with new check_pattern() calls."
    ],
    "description": "Prompt template for updating verification script with new customizations"
  },
  "Scan Customizations Command": {
    "prefix": "scan-custom",
    "body": [
      "./scripts/scan-paychex-customizations.sh ${1:30}"
    ],
    "description": "Command to scan for new Paychex customizations (default: 30 days)"
  },
  "Verify Customizations Command": {
    "prefix": "verify-custom",
    "body": [
      "./scripts/verify-paychex-customizations.sh"
    ],
    "description": "Command to verify all Paychex customizations are present"
  },
  "Paychex Customization Documentation": {
    "prefix": "paychex-custom-doc",
    "body": [
      "**${1:Customization Name}**",
      "- **File:** ${2:path/to/file.js}",
      "- **Method/Pattern:** `${3:methodName}`",
      "- **Purpose:** ${4:Description of what this does}",
      "- **Criticality:** ${5|CRITICAL,WARNING|}",
      "- **Added:** ${6:v0.8.x Paychex fork}",
      "- **Context:** ${7:Additional context or impact}"
    ],
    "description": "Template for documenting a new Paychex customization"
  },
  "Git Check Customization": {
    "prefix": "git-check-custom",
    "body": [
      "git log develop --oneline -- ${1:path/to/file}"
    ],
    "description": "Check git history for Paychex changes to a file"
  },
  "Git Diff Paychex Changes": {
    "prefix": "git-diff-paychex",
    "body": [
      "git diff upstream/main...develop -- ${1:path/to/file}"
    ],
    "description": "Show Paychex changes vs upstream for a file"
  }
}
